{"3764790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Night at Ashmere Manor", "steam_appid": 3764790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Cheryl Stewart</strong>, who has come to Cornwall in 1972 to find her father in the haunted house of <strong>Ashmere Manor</strong>. Explore the abandoned mansion, search for your father and deal with the restless spirits lurking in the darkness. Some might need a word of compassion - others a slug of salt from a shotgun - and some might not even be dead.  Darkness is everywhere and it’s up to you to not just survive, but bring the light. Figuratively and literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/56cdb736613c2c40423d16783376e3c3.poster.avif?t=1786431577\" width=820 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/56cdb736613c2c40423d16783376e3c3.webm?t=1786431577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Ashmere Manor, wandering its halls and revealing its secrets. The foreboding mansion and its denizens will tempt you into becoming one of them and staying forever. You must use your connection to the realm of your nightmares and your natural investigative skills to put the souls of Ashmere Manor to rest to escape with your soul - and find your father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/db8dc85b2f80700a23e0824d95be5713.poster.avif?t=1786431577\" width=712 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/db8dc85b2f80700a23e0824d95be5713.webm?t=1786431577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the occupants of Ashmere Manor, some of whom are eager to help, while some  are eager to damn you instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits and the items you find inside the mansion to uncover the truth and delve deeper into the mystery of Ashmere Manor. Can you find your father or will you become the house’s newest occupant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/e5961a526e01f6525b821bfb532fbe84.poster.avif?t=1786431577\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/e5961a526e01f6525b821bfb532fbe84.webm?t=1786431577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content &amp; Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third Person Horror with engaging story in three acts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric setting made with love for the genre in movies and games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate clues and solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee, avoid and fight with deadly opponents</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Cheryl Stewart</strong>, who has come to Cornwall in 1972 to find her father in the haunted house of <strong>Ashmere Manor</strong>. Explore the abandoned mansion, search for your father and deal with the restless spirits lurking in the darkness. Some might need a word of compassion - others a slug of salt from a shotgun - and some might not even be dead.  Darkness is everywhere and it’s up to you to not just survive, but bring the light. Figuratively and literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/56cdb736613c2c40423d16783376e3c3.poster.avif?t=1786431577\" width=820 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/56cdb736613c2c40423d16783376e3c3.webm?t=1786431577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Ashmere Manor, wandering its halls and revealing its secrets. The foreboding mansion and its denizens will tempt you into becoming one of them and staying forever. You must use your connection to the realm of your nightmares and your natural investigative skills to put the souls of Ashmere Manor to rest to escape with your soul - and find your father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/db8dc85b2f80700a23e0824d95be5713.poster.avif?t=1786431577\" width=712 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/db8dc85b2f80700a23e0824d95be5713.webm?t=1786431577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the occupants of Ashmere Manor, some of whom are eager to help, while some  are eager to damn you instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits and the items you find inside the mansion to uncover the truth and delve deeper into the mystery of Ashmere Manor. Can you find your father or will you become the house’s newest occupant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/e5961a526e01f6525b821bfb532fbe84.poster.avif?t=1786431577\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/extras/e5961a526e01f6525b821bfb532fbe84.webm?t=1786431577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content &amp; Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third Person Horror with engaging story in three acts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric setting made with love for the genre in movies and games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate clues and solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee, avoid and fight with deadly opponents</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "When your father goes missing with little more than a letter to clue you in, it's up to you to find him. His last known whereabouts? Ashmere Manor. Will you succeed in solving the mystery at the heart of the house and find your father, or will you succumb to its phantom call?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/5237e3b1b8b2f1c4ea43a8fc592985e4b47e20ed/header.jpg?t=1786431577", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/08e6254c745c835256ab4c9348bd9c8028261238/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786431577", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764790/08e6254c745c835256ab4c9348bd9c8028261238/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786431577", "website": "https://www.bandaloop.at", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11, 64-bit versions only<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core Intel or AMD<br></li><li><stro